{
  "sourceLanguage" : "ja",
  "strings" : {
    "%lld台が見ています（音も送っています）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld device is watching (sound is on too)"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "%lld devices are watching (sound is on too)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld台が視聴中" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld watching"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 台目に表示される QR コードを、2 台目の端末で読み取る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scan the QR code shown on the first device with your second device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 台目の端末" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "First device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 台目の端末で「新しく始める」を押す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On your first device, tap “Start fresh”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 台目からの端末" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Second device or later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2 台目を追加" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add your second device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR コードを表示" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Show QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "QR コードを読み取る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scan QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「QR コードを読み取る」を押す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap “Scan QR code”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いまは誰も見ていません" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No one is watching right now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この QR コードは家の鍵と同じです。写真に撮ったり、人に送ったりしないでください。写した人は映像を見られます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This QR code is like your house key. Don't photograph it or send it to anyone. Whoever has it can watch your video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この iPhone をカメラにする" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use this iPhone as a camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "このアプリの QR コードではありません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This QR code isn't from this app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末ではカメラを使えません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The camera isn't available on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末で新しい鍵を作ります。続けて、2 台目に読み取らせる QR コードを表示します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This creates a new key on this device, then shows a QR code for your second device to scan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末の鍵を消して、最初の設定からやり直します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This erases the key on this device and starts setup over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末は、どちらですか?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Which one is this device?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "すでに始めている端末で「端末を追加」を押し、表示された QR コードをこの端末で読み取ります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On a device that is already set up, tap “Add a device”, then scan the QR code it shows with this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "つながりません。この端末をカメラと同じ QR コードで設定したか、カメラの端末でアプリが開いているかを確かめてください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can't connect. Check that this device was set up with the same QR code as the camera, and that the app is open on the camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの端末ですでに始めているときは、ここは押さずに「QR コードを読み取る」を使ってください。別の鍵になり、つながりません。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you have already started on another device, don't tap this. Use “Scan QR code” instead. Otherwise this device gets a different key and can't connect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの端末とは、同じ QR コードで設定し直すまでつながらなくなります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This device can't connect to your other devices until you set it up again with the same QR code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ほかの端末をつなぐときは、下の「端末を追加」から QR コードを表示します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To connect another device, show the QR code from “Add a device” below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "もう 1 台の iPhone / iPad をつなぐときは、この端末に QR コードを表示して、追加する端末で読み取ります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To connect another iPhone or iPad, show a QR code on this device and scan it with the one you are adding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "やめる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラにする iPhone でアプリを開き、「カメラを始める」を押してください。同じ Wi-Fi にいるか、近くにあれば見つかります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open the app on the iPhone you want to use as a camera and tap “Start camera”. It will show up here if it's on the same Wi-Fi or nearby."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラにする端末と、映像を見る端末で、同じ鍵を持ちます。鍵が同じ端末どうしだけがつながり、通信は暗号化されます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The camera and the devices you watch from share one key. Only devices with the same key can connect, and everything they send is encrypted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラにつないでいます…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connecting to the camera…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラの使用が許可されていません。設定アプリで「%@」のカメラを許可してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Camera access is off. Allow the camera for “%@” in the Settings app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラの名前（例: リビング）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Camera name (e.g. Living room)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラの電池が少なくなっています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The camera's battery is low"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを始める" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを探しています…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Looking for cameras…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを探す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find cameras"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを止めますか？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop the camera?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを止める" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stop camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラを選ぶ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カメラ動作中" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Camera is on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "マイクが許可されていないので、話しかけられません。設定アプリで許可してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can't talk because microphone access is off. Turn it on in the Settings app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下の QR コードを写す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Point it at the QR code below"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使い始めるまで" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How to get started"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使っていない iPhone を、見守りたい場所に置きます。充電しながら、アプリを開いたままにしてください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Place a spare iPhone where you want to keep watch. Keep it charging with the app open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充電しながら、この画面を開いたままにしてください。\nしばらくすると画面が暗くなります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep this iPhone charging with this screen open.\nThe screen will dim after a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前面カメラに切り替える" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switch to front camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "家の中で動いているカメラを探して、映像と音を確認します。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Find a camera running in your home, then watch and listen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待ち受けに失敗: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stopped accepting viewers: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待ち受けを待機中: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waiting to accept viewers: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "待ち受けを開始できません: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Can't accept viewers: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "戻る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "押しているあいだ話しかける" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold to talk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "押して話す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold to talk"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "探索に失敗: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't look for cameras: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "探索を待機中: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waiting to look for cameras: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新しく始める" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start fresh"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "映像は、家の中の端末どうしでだけやり取りします" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Video stays between the devices in your home"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "映像を見る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "案内を閉じる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dismiss this tip"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "準備ができました" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're all set"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "片方をカメラにして置き、もう片方で映像を見る" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Set one down as the camera and watch from the other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面をタップすると戻ります" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the screen to wake it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末をつなぐ準備" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Get your devices ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末を追加" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add a device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "端末を追加するための QR コード" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "QR code for adding a device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "背面カメラに切り替える" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Switch to back camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見ている端末には映像が届かなくなります。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Devices that are watching will stop receiving video."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "見守りたい場所に置く端末で「カメラを始める」を、手元の端末で「カメラを探す」を押してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap “Start camera” on the device you leave where you want to watch, and “Find cameras” on the device you keep with you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定をやり直す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start setup over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定を開く" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定済みの端末で「端末を追加」を押し、表示された QR コードを枠に入れてください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On a device that is already set up, tap “Add a device”, then fit the QR code it shows in the frame."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "話しています" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Talking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読み取りが済んだら、次へ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Done scanning? Continue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "追加する端末で、%@を開く" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open %@ on the device you are adding"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鍵を作りました。続けて、もう 1 台の端末をつなぎます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The key is ready. Next, connect one more device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鍵を保存できませんでした。もう一度試してください。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't save the key. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鍵を消してやり直す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erase key and start over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "閉じる" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音を出す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unmute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音を消す" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mute"
          }
        }
